---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><title>Bisq 2 | Bisq documentation</title><style>body{font:1.05rem/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:48rem;margin:3rem auto;padding:0 1.25rem;color:#1c2820;background:#f9fbf9}a{color:#176a30}h1,h2{line-height:1.2}</style></head>
<body data-pagefind-ignore>
  <main>
    <p><a href={`${base}/`}>Bisq documentation</a> / Legacy page</p>
    <h1>Bisq 2</h1>
    <p>This compatibility page preserves selected links from the former wiki. This documentation recovery pilot is incomplete and is undergoing editorial review. See the <a href={`${base}/recovery-status/`}>recovery status</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="Installation">Installation</h2>
    <p>Read the current pilot guide to <a href={`${base}/bisq-2/install-and-verify/`}>installing and verifying Bisq 2</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="Known_issues_with_installation">Known issues with installation</h2>
    <p>See the <a href={`${base}/bisq-2/install-and-verify/`}>installation guide</a> and its linked sources. Not all historical troubleshooting material has been recovered.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
